  "title": "Slow Cooker Overnight Oatmeal with Apples, Cranberries, and Walnuts",
  "description": "This slow cooker overnight oatmeal with apples, cranberries, and walnuts recipe is an easy way to enjoy steel-cut oats. Leftovers make a quick breakfast.",
